node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.log
docs/screenshots/

# Report builders crop their source captures at build time and write the result
# back beside them; the originals are the evidence, the crops are output.
docs/assets/crop-*.png
docs/assets/**/crop-*.png

# The FigJam capture harness writes its raw readings and shots here; the
# distilled readings the product is checked against live in docs/assets/.
tools/figjam/appearance/
tools/figjam/shots/

# Report media — never Git history. A tracked report references these captures relatively,
# and `review_runtime.py up --report-media reports/media/<name>` copies them into the
# retained pinned review before Vite serves the page. That makes a later restart independent
# of the implementation worktree without turning the source repository into a video archive.
# `tests/test_report_weight.py` keeps the tracked page free of inlined capture payload.
reports/media/
